body.en:
**Missing data** are **absent values** in a dataset. They can come from:
- **entry or measurement errors**;
- **non-responses** in surveys;
- **technical problems** (sensors, databases, etc.).

Handling them is an **essential preprocessing step**, because they can **bias statistical analyses** or **distort machine-learning models**.
